rl":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:55:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5182680-1846651706682806","game_id":"steam-5182680","kind":"update","title":"Cash & Stash Demo Update #1","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46298730/86a57134f6cf0ef65914c72cd98a1f6e978c4b2a.png Fixes Fixed cases where safe-deposit boxes stopped accepting items, including after Eject. Fixed an interaction issue when placing several items into a safe-deposit box in succession. Fixed an issue where a safe-deposit box stopped recognizing an inserted dossier. Fixed unreadable Eject button labels in some languages. Footsteps, item pickup and drop sounds, and safe-deposit box interaction sounds no","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:56:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:55:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5182680-1846651706681159","game_id":"steam-5182680","kind":"announcement","title":"Cash & Stash Demo Is Live!","summary":"https://clan.fastly.steamstatic.com/images/46298730/14e99818277afbd76b9348dbd5917b0432f47172.png The vault is open, and we’ve got a rather expensive mess for you to sort out. The Cash & Stash demo is now available on Steam! Step into a bank vault left in chaos after a heist. Sort scattered cash, put gold bars back where they belong, and piece together the stories behind the clients’ safe-deposit boxes. We’d love to hear how your time in the vault goes. What was satisfying? What felt confusing? D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T11:51:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681159",